# Build outputs of local-patch/build_asar.py.
#
# resources/app.asar is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the shipped runtime the app
# actually loads, and build_asar.py needs an existing asar as the header template to
# build from. These two are just copies of it produced during a rebuild.
local-patch/app.asar.new
Caption assistance-1.0.2-local/resources/app.asar.pending

# API keys, if ever placed next to the app instead of userData
*-key.txt
